WEBVTT

00:03:27.836 --> 00:03:30.196
RS: We need the government
and the private sector,

00:03:30.236 --> 00:03:35.116
everybody, quite frankly,
to re-imagine women in the workplace.

00:03:36.116 --> 00:03:39.236
And so when I talk to moms

00:03:39.276 --> 00:03:41.836
about what it is
that they needed, you know,

00:03:41.876 --> 00:03:45.316
to be able to, again,
reconcile those two identities

00:03:45.356 --> 00:03:48.596
as the caretaker and as a worker,

00:03:48.596 --> 00:03:50.636
you know, I kind of heard the same thing.

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:53.796
And it wasn't not that "Wow."

00:03:53.836 --> 00:03:55.236
Like, it was obvious.

00:03:55.276 --> 00:03:58.156
Moms said, you know,
“I need paid leave.”

00:03:58.476 --> 00:03:59.636
We're, like I said,

00:03:59.636 --> 00:04:02.876
the only industrialized nation
that doesn't offer paid leave.